        "text": "Security update for rustup",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for rustup fixes the following issues\n\n- CVE-2026-25727: time: parsing of user-provided input by the RFC 2822 date parser can lead to stack exhaustion\n  (bsc#1257902).\n- rust-shlex: Multiple issues involving quote API (RUSTSEC-2024-0006, GHSA-r7qv-8r2h-pg27) (bsc#1230032).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
